    "rooney": "19 Oct 2002, Everton 2-1 Arsenal at Goodison, late winner past David Seaman, ended Arsenal's 30-game unbeaten run; 16y 360d; Clive Tyldesley 'Remember the name'",
    "milner": "26 Dec 2002, scored for Leeds v Sunderland aged 16y 356d, 4 days younger than Rooney; Rooney's record lasted 68 days (19 Oct -> 26 Dec)",
    "vaughan": "10 Apr 2005, Everton 4-0 Crystal Palace, sub, scored the 4th; 16y 270d (some sources 271)",
    "dowman": "14 Mar 2026, Arsenal 2-0 Everton; on 74'; crossed for the first (Hincapie -> Gyokeres); in stoppage time Pickford went up for a corner, Dowman won the loose ball, ran half the pitch, scored into an empty net; 16y 73d, 197 days younger than Vaughan; PL champion May 2026"
